AntiFeatures:
  NonFreeNet:
    en-US: Optional Google Calendar integration and the suggested Google Drive destination
      use proprietary services. The diary works offline and backups support other
      Android document providers.
  NonFreeAdd:
    en-US: Optional swimming imports mention Mi Fitness and Samsung Health, which
      are proprietary apps. They are not required for the local diary.
Categories:
  - Sports & Health
